id=picoet-enhance
name=PicoET-Enhance
version=2.0.2
versionCode=12
author=PicoFacialBridge
description=Runtime eye-tracking enhancement by ptrace injection: opens the service-local per-eye gate and enables per-eye (dual) or left/right gaze. Ships no PICO bytes, writes no system file and no persistent property; ro.pxr.externalfunc is never touched. Switch live with picoet.sh: off | left | right | dual | gate on|off.
